{"vid":"mQcyaFMGz0o","source":"mQcyaFMGz0o.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0.4,"txt":"[BILL BARNETT] We help you put in place the systems that will help your"},{"t":4.3,"txt":"people be truly creative."},{"t":7.8,"txt":"The Stanford Executive Program is an immersive"},{"t":10.9,"txt":"educational experience for senior leaders to move into"},{"t":16.5,"txt":"the next chapter of their life."},{"t":18.6,"txt":"[KATHERINE SANDELL] You cannot replicate the environment that SEP provides."},{"t":22.1,"txt":"[IKROOP DHILLON] I tell people all the time, it is the best investment"},{"t":25.4,"txt":"I've made in myself."},{"t":26.8,"txt":"[ERIC WEI] The Creativity Unlock really helps you."},{"t":29.9,"txt":"Think about things in new ways, allowing yourself to be"},{"t":32.8,"txt":"influenced, allowing yourself to be surprised."},{"t":37.3,"txt":"[BILL BARNETT] So much learning gives you essentially"},{"t":40.6,"txt":"snippets of headlines."},{"t":43.1,"txt":"Our faculty specialize in doing research at"},{"t":46.5,"txt":"the underlying issues."},{"t":48.6,"txt":"So they change the way you think of problems."},{"t":52.6,"txt":"[WES HARTMANN] You're gonna get my three best sessions in marketing."},{"t":55.6,"txt":"You're gonna get the best sessions in accounting."},{"t":57.9,"txt":"You're gonna get the best sessions in finance."},{"t":60.1,"txt":"[IKROOP DHILLON] Having this framework to really understand deeply"},{"t":64,"txt":"I feel like my lens through which I lead has"},{"t":67.7,"txt":"expanded significantly."},{"t":69.6,"txt":"It has been completely transformative."},{"t":72.9,"txt":"[GREG CULLEN] We weren't just sitting in classrooms."},{"t":75,"txt":"There was a lot of focus on trying to make sure that we're"},{"t":77.3,"txt":"being balanced in our lives, that we're thinking about our"},{"t":79.5,"txt":"whole selves and how to keep all parts of our lives healthy."},{"t":82.2,"txt":"[KATHERINE SANDELL] I feel a lot more balanced in my industry as well as"},{"t":85.3,"txt":"kind of at home and with the culture around me."},{"t":88,"txt":"I'm already feeling like I can do"},{"t":90.3,"txt":"More with a lot more intentionality."},{"t":93.3,"txt":"[GREG CULLEN] I think what surprised me the most was what I got out of the"},{"t":97.3,"txt":"conversations with my cohort."},{"t":99.3,"txt":"[KATHERINE SANDELL] The water cooler talks that we have,"},{"t":101.5,"txt":"the deep relationships that I've started to bond with."},{"t":104.4,"txt":"[IKROOP DHILLON] It's really like having a magical space with all of"},{"t":108.2,"txt":"these north stars together."},{"t":110.8,"txt":"[ERIC WEI] And it just changes your perspective on what you"},{"t":112.8,"txt":"can do in this world."},{"t":113.9,"txt":"[GREG CULLEN] We never arrive as leaders."},{"t":115.6,"txt":"We have to continue to learn and grow."},{"t":118.1,"txt":"And I don't know if there's a better way"},{"t":119.8,"txt":"to do that than through SEP."},{"t":121.4,"txt":"[KATHERINE SANDELL] I think it's created a deep foundation of growth"},{"t":123.9,"txt":"that I can continue on for many, many years."}],"words":[{"t":0.4,"w":"[BILL"},{"t":0.4,"w":"BARNETT]"},{"t":0.4,"w":"We"},{"t":0.4,"w":"help"},{"t":0.4,"w":"you"},{"t":0.4,"w":"put"},{"t":0.4,"w":"in"},{"t":0.4,"w":"place"},{"t":0.4,"w":"the"},{"t":0.4,"w":"systems"},{"t":0.4,"w":"that"},{"t":0.4,"w":"will"},{"t":0.4,"w":"help"},{"t":0.4,"w":"your"},{"t":4.28,"w":"people"},{"t":4.28,"w":"be"},{"t":4.28,"w":"truly"},{"t":4.28,"w":"creative."},{"t":7.8,"w":"The"},{"t":7.8,"w":"Stanford"},{"t":7.8,"w":"Executive"},{"t":7.8,"w":"Program"},{"t":7.8,"w":"is"},{"t":7.8,"w":"an"},{"t":7.8,"w":"immersive"},{"t":10.9,"w":"educational"},{"t":10.9,"w":"experience"},{"t":10.9,"w":"for"},{"t":10.9,"w":"senior"},{"t":10.9,"w":"leaders"},{"t":10.9,"w":"to"},{"t":10.9,"w":"move"},{"t":10.9,"w":"into"},{"t":16.54,"w":"the"},{"t":16.54,"w":"next"},{"t":16.54,"w":"chapter"},{"t":16.54,"w":"of"},{"t":16.54,"w":"their"},{"t":16.54,"w":"life."},{"t":18.56